msgid "Tracking param name"
msgstr "Name des Tracking-Parameters"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:87
msgctxt "Tracking parameter setting description"
msgid "Use <code>via</code>, <code>buddy</code>, <code>aff</code> or any other word (Default is <code>ref</code>). "
msgstr "Verwende <code>via</code>, <code>buddy</code>, <code>aff</code> oder ein beliebiges anderes Wort (Standard ist <code>ref</code>). "

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:90
msgctxt "Tracking parameter setting placeholder text"
msgid "Leaving this blank will use default value ref"
msgstr "Wenn du dieses Feld leer lässt, wird der Standardwert „ref“ verwendet."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:94
msgctxt "setting name to personalize affiliate identifier"
msgid "Personalize affiliate identifier"
msgstr "Partner-ID anpassen"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:95
msgctxt "setting description for personalizing affiliate identifier"
msgid "Allow affiliates to use something other than {user_id} as referral identifier"
msgstr "Erlaube Partnern, statt {user_id} etwas anderes als Empfehlungskennung zu verwenden"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:99
msgctxt "setting description tip for personalizing affiliate identifier"
msgid "Good idea to keep this on. This allows \"friendly\" looking links - because people can use their brand name instead of {user_id}."
msgstr "Gute Idee, das so zu belassen. So entstehen „freundlich“ aussehende Links – denn die Leute können ihren Markennamen anstelle von {user_id} verwenden."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:103
msgctxt "setting name for pretty affiliate links"
msgid "Pretty affiliate links"
msgstr "Schöne Affiliate-Links"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:104
msgctxt "setting description for pretty affiliate links"
msgid "Automatically convert default affiliate referral links to beautiful links"
msgstr "Standard-Partnerlinks automatisch in ansprechende Links umwandeln"

#. translators: %1$s: Pretty affiliate link %2$s: Default affiliate link
#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:109
#, php-format
msgctxt "setting description tip for pretty affiliate links"
msgid "When enabled, the affiliate links will look like <strong>%1$s</strong> instead of %2$s."
msgstr "Wenn diese Funktion aktiviert ist, sehen die Affiliate-Links so aus: <strong>%1$s</strong> statt %2$s."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:113
msgctxt "setting name for direct links"
msgid "Direct link tracking"
msgstr "Direkte Link-Verfolgung"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:114
msgctxt "setting description for direct link tracking"
msgid "Allow affiliates to track referrals via their domains"
msgstr "Erlaube Partnern, Empfehlungen über ihre Domains nachzuverfolgen"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:118
msgctxt "setting description tip for direct link tracking"
msgid "Record referrals from an affiliate’s linked domains without requiring referral links. Supports multiple domains per affiliate (admin approval required)."
msgstr "Erfasse Zugriffe von den verlinkten Domains eines Partners, ohne dass Referral-Links erforderlich sind. Unterstützt mehrere Domains pro Partner (Genehmigung durch den Administrator erforderlich)."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:126
msgctxt "setting name for coupons for referral"
msgid "Coupons for referral"
msgstr "Gutscheine für Weiterempfehlungen"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:127
msgctxt "setting description of using coupons for referral"
msgid "Use coupons for referral - along with affiliated links"
msgstr "Nutze Gutscheine für Empfehlungen – zusammen mit Affiliate-Links"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:131
msgctxt "setting description tip of using coupons for referral"
msgid "Use the <code>Assign to affiliate</code> option while creating a coupon to link the coupon with an affiliate. Whenever that coupon is used, specified affiliate will be credited for the sale."
msgstr "Nutze beim Erstellen eines Gutscheins die Option <code>„Einem Partner zuweisen“</code>, um den Gutschein mit einem Partner zu verknüpfen. Immer wenn dieser Gutschein eingelöst wird, wird der angegebene Partner für den Verkauf vergütet."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:135
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "Affiliate-made coupons"
msgstr "Von Partnern erstellte Gutscheine"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:136
msgctxt "setting description"
msgid "Allow affiliates to create their own referral coupons"
msgstr "Ermögliche es deinen Partnern, ihre eigenen Empfehlungsgutscheine zu erstellen"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:137
msgctxt "setting description tip"
msgid "When enabled, affiliates can create one <code>Percentage discount</code> coupon from My Account > Affiliates > Profile."
msgstr "Wenn diese Funktion aktiviert ist, können Partner unter „Mein Konto“ > „Partner“ > „Profil“ einen <code>prozentigen Rabatt</code>-Gutschein erstellen."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:149
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "Affiliate coupon discount limit"
msgstr "Rabattgrenze für Affiliate-Gutscheine"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:150
msgctxt "setting description"
msgid "Set the highest discount an affiliate can add to their referral coupon. Enter 0 if you don't want the coupon to give any discount."
msgstr "Lege den höchsten Rabatt fest, den ein Partner seinem Empfehlungsgutschein hinzufügen kann. Gib 0 ein, wenn der Gutschein keinen Rabatt gewähren soll."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:155
msgctxt "placeholder value placeholder"
msgid "Enter maximum discount percentage. Default is 0."
msgstr "Gib den maximalen Rabattprozentsatz ein. Der Standardwert ist 0."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:164
msgctxt "setting name for multi-tier affiliate program"
msgid "Multi-tier affiliate program"
msgstr "Mehrstufiges Partnerprogramm"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:165
msgctxt "Description for multi-tier affiliate program"
msgid "Allow existing affiliates to invite others to join your affiliate program, earning extra commissions from their referrals"
msgstr "Erlaube bestehenden Partnern, andere einzuladen, deinem Partnerprogramm beizutreten, und so zusätzliche Provisionen für deren Empfehlungen zu verdienen"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:166
msgctxt "Description tip for multi-tier affiliate program"
msgid "Existing (parent) affiliates will receive commissions on referrals of children affiliates - as long as active. Disabling this will remove the relationship as well as prevent commissions."
msgstr "Bestehende (übergeordnete) Partner erhalten Provisionen für die Vermittlung von untergeordneten Partnern – solange diese aktiv sind. Wenn du diese Option deaktivierst, wird die Verbindung aufgehoben und es fallen keine Provisionen mehr an."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:173
msgctxt "setting name to credit first or last affiliate during referral"
msgid "Credit first/last affiliate"
msgstr "Erster/letzter Partner angeben"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:177
msgctxt "Option to credit first affiliate"
msgid "First - Credit the first affiliate who referred the customer."
msgstr "Erstens: Die Provision geht an den ersten Partner, der den Kunden vermittelt hat."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:178
msgctxt "Option to credit last affiliate"
msgid "Last - Credit the last/latest affiliate who referred the customer."
msgstr "Zuletzt – Die Provision geht an den letzten/aktuellen Partner, der den Kunden geworben hat."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:183
msgctxt "setting name for affiliate self-refer"
msgid "Affiliate self-refer"
msgstr "Selbstverweis durch Partner"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:184
msgctxt "Description for affiliate self-refer setting"
msgid "Allow affiliates to earn commissions on their own orders"
msgstr "Ermögliche es Affiliates, Provisionen für ihre eigenen Bestellungen zu verdienen"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:185
msgctxt "Description tip for affiliate self-refer setting"
msgid "Disabling this will not record a commission if an affiliate uses their own referral link/coupons during orders."
msgstr "Wenn du diese Option deaktivierst, wird keine Provision gutgeschrieben, wenn ein Partner bei Bestellungen seinen eigenen Empfehlungslink oder Gutscheine verwendet."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:192
msgctxt "setting name to show affiliate referral link for a product"
msgid "Show affiliate referral link for a product"
msgstr "Affiliate-Empfehlungslink für ein Produkt anzeigen"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:193
msgctxt "setting description of showing affiliate referral link for a product"
msgid "Allow affiliates to quickly copy their affiliate referral link for a specific product from a single product page"
msgstr "Ermögliche es Affiliates, ihren Affiliate-Empfehlungslink für ein bestimmtes Produkt schnell von einer einzelnen Produktseite zu kopieren"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:197
msgctxt "setting description tip for showing affiliate referral link for a product"
msgid "When enabled, a \"Click to copy referral link\" button will appear for active affiliates on all products except the ones listed under \"Excluded products\" and assigned to the affiliate via a \"Landing page\"."
msgstr "Wenn diese Funktion aktiviert ist, erscheint für aktive Partner bei allen Produkten – mit Ausnahme der unter „Ausgeschlossene Produkte“ aufgeführten – eine Schaltfläche „Zum Kopieren des Empfehlungslinks hier klicken“, sofern das Produkt dem Partner über eine „Landingpage“ zugewiesen wurde."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:201
msgctxt "setting name to send referral details to admin"
msgid "Send referral details to admin"
msgstr "Sende die Angaben zur Empfehlung an den Administrator"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:203
msgctxt "setting description tip for sending referral details to admin"
msgid "Disabling this will not include affiliate referral details in the email to admin."
msgstr "Wenn du diese Option deaktivierst, werden die Angaben zur Partnerempfehlung nicht in die E-Mail an den Admin aufgenommen."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-referrals-admin-settings.php:248
msgctxt "Tracking param name field sanitization error message"
msgid "Tracking param name cannot start with a number and can contain only letters, numbers, dashes and underscores. Invalid characters were removed."
msgstr "Der Name eines Tracking-Parameters darf nicht mit einer Zahl beginnen und darf nur Buchstaben, Zahlen, Bindestriche und Unterstriche enthalten. Ungültige Zeichen wurden entfernt."

